root = Stack([m])
m = Markdown("## Rollout notes\n\nRun this on the gateway first, then check the table below:\n\n```bash\nkubectl rollout status deployment/billing-api-gateway --namespace production --timeout=300s && kubectl get pods -l app=billing-api-gateway -o wide\n```\n\n| service | status | region | owner | notes | updated |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| billing-api-gateway | degraded | us-east-1 | platform team | rolling restart in progress | 2026-11-14 |\n| auth | up | eu-west-2 | identity | certificate renewed | 2026-11-13 |\n\nA word too long for any line: abcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghijabcdefghij")
